# "Ultimate" state: everything gated by progression is made visible (see docs/DEV.md, task DEV4). Usage: step `do,dev/ultimate.steps`.
call,HoverTooltip.offForever
call,HoverTooltip.hideTutorialTooltip
set,Character.firstBossEver,false
set,Character.bossID,1000
set,Character.highestBoss,1000
set,Character.magic.capMagic,100000000
ultimate
call,ButtonShower.updateButtons
call,Character.refreshMenus
w,30
